  <div class="container">
  <h3 style="color: #09919c; font-weight: bold;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 22px;">Principal's Message</h3>
  	<img src="BGC_Images/sld/jagtap.jpg" alt="" align="left" style="margin:0px 10px 10px 0px; height: 120px;width: auto;"/>
		<p  style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">
		 <b>Dear Student's</b><br>
         I extend you a warm welcome at Pune District Education Association's BaburaojiGholap College, Sangvi, Pune. The college is affiliated to Savitribai Phule Pune University and included under 
         section 2(f) and 12(B) of University Grant Commission, New Delhi. In the year 2023-24,
         the college is accrediated by NAAC with B++ Grade The vision of college aims at educating and enlightening the minds through quality research and life skills. The mission of college is 
         "Evolving and Reinventing Knowledge,Skills in an Ethical Mould to Greet the Emerging Times".
		</p>
		<p  style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">
		With the aim to facilitate higher education at undergraduate and post graduate levels,under Arts faculty,the college offers B.A.and M.A.in Marathi,
		 English, History, Economics and Political Science. From the year2024-25,
		 the college has adopted NEP2020 for all first year programes as per SPPU guidelines.
		 Under Commerce faculty,college offers B.Com. in Banking and Finance,Cost an dWorks Accounting and Marketing Management, BBA in Computer Application, Diploma in Taxation Law (DTL) and M.Com. in Banking and Finance and Advanced Cost and Works Accounting.
		 Under Science faculty,college offers B.Sc.in Physics,Chemistry,Botany and ComputerScience and M.Sc.in 
		 Physics,Organic Chemistry,Analytical Chemistry,Botany,Environmental Science and ComputerScience.
		 Under skillbased higher education, the college offers B.Voc. in Fashion Technology, Software Development, Retail Management,Travel andTourism Management, 
		</p>
  		<p style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">
  		Beauty Therapy and Aesthetics and M.Voc. in Fashion Technology and  SoftwareDevelopment and Management.Thecollege is also running M.B.A. Distance learning program affiliated to SavitribaiPhule Pune University School of open learning.
  		 The college has seven Ph.D. research centres in Economics, Chemistry, Physics, Environmental Science, Commerce, English and Political Science. In addition, we also provide UGC approved vocational courses: Advanced Diploma in Biomedical Instrumentation, and Certificate courses in Goods and ServicesTax(GST),LaboratoryChemist-Rubber,AnimationandMultimedia,AgroTourismandMassageTherapy.InneweraofNational Education Policy 2020, the college is totally engaged with establishment and delivering the "Learning Outcomes-based Education" in professionalandnon-professional courses along with skill based vocational programs.
        </p>
  		<p style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">
  		The college is well equipped with infrastructure and provides all facilities for the personality development 
  		of the student.Thecollege has active alumni and placement cell for the community-industry-institute interface 
  		and better employability.The ICTenabled Departments, Classrooms,
  		well equipped Laboratories and Library facilitate virtual as well as offline campus education.
  		The college is having facilities like ConferenceHall,wellequippedGymnasium.OpenGym,Indoor-outdoorGames,
  		Playground,Botanicalgarden,CanteenandEco-friendly systems like Waterharvesting plant,Compositepit,
  		HoneyBee plant and SolarSystem.I am very happy to provide you the best services and facilities like guidance,
  		 sports activities, NSS, NCC, Gymkhana etc. for overall development of students. The college organizes various curricular, co-curricular and extra-curricular activities/programs for holistic development of students.Theremarkable activities are village survey, e-content development workshop, value based educational workshops, national-international webinars, DnyansetuVidnyanPrasarUpkarm,ScienceDay,Guestlectures,Collection and Recycling of Plastic,programs on Yoga and Stress management and Researchproject competition etc.
  		</p>
  		<p style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">
  		The college is rewarded with grants to enhance research activities, improve the teaching-learning activities and inculcate professional skill samong students.
  		The college is also recipient of grants under different schemes like General Development Assistance,
  		 Community College and B.Voc. by UGC,DST-FIST,DBT Starcollege.The college is awarded with first prize for 
  		 &apos;Jagar Jani vancha&apos;in 2013 and 2014 at University level by Government of Maharashtra.
  		 The college is also awarded with &apos;BestCollege&apos;in 2014 and &apos;BestPrincipal&apos;in 2019 
  		 by Savitribai Phule Pune University.Thecollege is re-accredited 
  		 with'B+'gradebyNAACBangalorein2018-2019.
  		 In academicyear 2021-2022,the college is awarded with second prize for "Magazine" by 
  		 SavitribaiPhulePuneUniversity.Onoccasionof"Bharat Ki Ajadi ka Amrut Mahostav",the college is 
  		 honoured with &apos;SwachhBharatAbhiyan2021-2022 and 2022-2023 District level Puraskar &apos;byNehruYuva Kendra, Pimpri Chinchwad, Pune, for plastic collection college.
  		</p>
  		<p  style="color: #09919c;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;">
		Dr.SangeetaJagtap<br/>
		Principal</p>
